---
import { analyticsConfig } from '../../analytics.config.mjs';
const active = analyticsConfig() !== null;
---

<section aria-labelledby="website-data">
  <h2 id="website-data">Website data</h2>
  {active ? (
    <>
      <p>
        The production website uses Umami Cloud for aggregate page views and
        download or store-link clicks. It sends the page path and title,
        hostname, referring website origin, and, for these clicks, the app name
        and download version where applicable. URL queries and fragments are
        excluded. Umami receives connection information when processing these
        requests. Its Hobby plan retains analytics for six months.
      </p>
      <p>
        Collection respects Do Not Track and uses no tracking cookies or
        personal user identifiers. We do not enable session replay or additional
        performance tracking. Counts are approximate, and clicking a link does
        not establish a completed download or installation. Website analytics is
        separate from app data handling.
      </p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <p>
      This website does not currently collect page-view or link-click analytics.
      Website hosting and voluntary support email still involve the providers
      described in the website privacy policy, separately from app data.
    </p>
  )}
  <p>The public review site is untracked.</p>
</section>
